WEBVTT

00:12:30.746 --> 00:12:33.165
So while we never shun our idealism,

00:12:33.207 --> 00:12:36.543
it's a stubborn thing we learn early on

00:12:36.585 --> 00:12:37.836
to wear it lightly.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:44.551
Folks, let's stop selling ourselves short.

00:12:45.969 --> 00:12:49.973
We are capable of being small,
but we are not small beings.

00:12:51.141 --> 00:12:54.311
We help strangers whom we know
we will never see again.

00:12:55.062 --> 00:12:56.313
We grieve.

00:12:57.397 --> 00:13:00.359
We grieve for strangers
who are oceans away.